  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Health Sector Reform.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Reforma del Sector Salud</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la serie programtica es mejorar la cobertura, eficiencia y la calidad del Sistema Nacional de Salud (SNS) en la provisin de servicios para la mejora del nivel de salud de la poblacin de todo el pas. La primera operacin apoyar la preparacin y adopcin de herramientas para el fortalecimiento del Modelo de
Gestin Descentralizada (MGD), as como de un marco legal y normativo para implementar la reforma de salud y cambiar el modelo de provisin y organizacin de servicios. Adems, apoyar la definicin de una Estrategia Nacional de Calidad (ENC), la restructuracin del presupuesto de la SESAL y la definicin de un sistema de gestin y control de RRHH. La presente operacin es la primera de una serie Programtica en Apoyo de Reformas de Poltica (PBP), a conformarse de dos prstamos contractualmente independientes y tcnicamente vinculados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programmatic series is to enhance the coverage, efficiency, and quality of the National Health System in the delivery of services to improve the health of the population throughout the country. The first operation will support the preparation and adoption of tools to strengthen the Decentralized Management Model, as well as a legal and regulatory framework for implementing health reform and changing the service delivery and organization model. It will also support the formulation of the National Quality Strategy, the restructuring of the Ministry of Health budget, and the development of a human resources
management and control system. This is the first operation in a programmatic policy-based series (PBP), to be comprised of two contractually independent and technically linked loans.</narrative>
  </description>
